<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Vattenfall, Finnish IVO to split j/v's.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Vattenfall, Finnish IVO to split j/v's.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish state-owned power company Vattenfall on Wednesday said it and Finnish state-owned power company Imatran Voima Oy would separate their three Baltic joint ventures because of changed market conditions.</p>
</text>
